    "reason": "Two gates read the key \"artifact_sha256\" on the Phase-8 and Phase-9 manifests. Neither manifest uses that key, so both gates iterated an empty dict and passed without verifying anything. They are replaced by resolver-driven verification of every recorded digest, plus explicit non-vacuity floors, so a check that verifies nothing now fails instead of passing.",
