    "second_amendment": "Two gates compared current HEAD to the recorded Phase-10 closure by equality: the Git-discipline gate and the manuscript-freeze gate. Equality holds only while Phase 11 is uncommitted, so committing the package would have made this validator fail on its own commit. Both now use freeze-point ancestry, the pattern validate_phase8_postopening already uses. The first instance was corrected before the commit and the second was caught by the commit itself."
